  "label": "Stephen Hawking seated in wheelchair with assistive technology",
  "description": "The scene depicts Stephen Hawking seated in his motorized wheelchair, equipped with assistive technology including a communication device mounted on a metal arm. He is wearing glasses and a dark jacket, looking slightly to his right with a neutral or slightly amused expression. The background is plain and light-colored, focusing attention on Hawking and his equipment. The overlaid text 'no one: steven hawking' is positioned at the top of the image, creating a meme context that frames Hawking as the sole exception to a rule, implying he is the only one who cannot do something (presumably 'no one' can do it, but Hawking is the exception). This text is visually positioned above him, creating a spatial hierarchy where the text is the 'speaker' or 'commentator' and Hawking is the 'subject' of the statement.",
